<title>USA: Telepad wins Seattle contract.</title>
<headline>Telepad wins Seattle contract.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telepad Corp said Friday the city of Seattle plans to enter into an agreement with the company for up to 1,200 in-vehicle mobile computer units.</p>
<p>The contract is worth up to $6 million over three years.</p>
<p>Telepad said it would provide mobile wireless computers with Internet access to the city's fire, police and utilities departments.</p>
